:: Dramatis_Personae [codex] {"position":"260,240","size":"100,100"}
## 👥 Dramatis Personae (Cast of Characters)

### Elena Cross *(CharacterRole.PROTAGONIST)*
Former Spire cipher analyst whose memory was selectively erased after stumbling upon Council corruption.

### Julian Sterling *(CharacterRole.ANTAGONIST)*
Architect of the city's memory-scrubbing registry who rose to Councilman through orchestrated amnesia.

### Orin Vance *(CharacterRole.ALLY)*
Black-market data slicer operating out of the drainage conduits.

### Dr. Maya Lin *(CharacterRole.ALLY)*
Neuro-archivist secretly cataloguing suppressed neural backups in the lower city.

### Commander Varek Kane *(CharacterRole.ANTAGONIST_ALLY)*
Spire security director tasked with cleaning up loose cipher fragments.

### Tariq 'The Broker' Chen *(CharacterRole.NEUTRAL)*
Underworld broker trading in erased identity chips and black market permits.

### Orin Vance *(Black-market data slicer)*
### Tariq Chen *(Contraband Broker)*

